    "C": "(a) $S(2)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$; (b) $S(-x)=S(x)$; (c) $S(-2)=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$",
    "D": "(a) $S(2)=\\frac{2\\pi}{3}$; (b) $S(-x)=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-S(x)$; (c) $S(-2)=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$"
